-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-12-11">5) Suitability for All Application Classes</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-12-12"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-   The TIP protocol should be complete and robust enough not only for
