-            An invalid transaction identifier has been provided.
-      <xref target="TIPNOCURRENTTX" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPNOCURRENTTX"/>
-            Process is currently not associated with a transaction
-            (and none was supplied).
-      <xref target="TIPINVALIDHANDLE" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPINVALIDHANDLE"/>
-            Invalid connection handle specified.
-      <xref target="TIPNOTPUSHED" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPNOTPUSHED"/></t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-6"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-            Transaction could not be pushed to the remote node.
-      [TIPNOTCONNECTED]
-            Caller has been disconnected from the TIP TM.
