-      <xref target="TIPOK" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPOK"/>
-            The local transaction has been successfully joined with
-            the TIP transaction.
-      <xref target="TIPINVALIDHANDLE" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPINVALIDHANDLE"/>
-            Invalid connection handle specified.
-      <xref target="TIPINVALIDXID" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPINVALIDXID"/>
-            An invalid transaction identifier has been provided.
-      <xref target="TIPNOTPULLED" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPNOTPULLED"/>
-            Joining of the local transaction with the TIP transaction
-            has failed. The local transaction has been aborted.
-      <xref target="TIPNOTCONNECTED" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPNOTCONNECTED"/>
-            Caller has been disconnected from the TIP TM.
-      <xref target="TIPERROR" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TIPERROR"/>
-            An unexpected error occurred.</t>
